## 7. MOBILE & PWA CAPABILITIES (CAPACITOR + ANDROID)

- **Capacitor Configuration (`capacitor.config.ts`)**:
  - App ID: `com.webguruji.chat`
  - App Name: `WebGuruJi Chat`
  - Web Dir: `dist`
- **Native Android Optimizations**:
  - `Keyboard.setResizeMode({ mode: KeyboardResize.Native })` for viewport pushing without breaking chat history.
  - Safe-area insets (`env(safe-area-inset-top)` & `env(safe-area-inset-bottom)`) for edge-to-edge screens.
  - Android Back Button handler: Closes open modals, then active conversation, and exits app on double-tap.
  - Native Push Notifications via `@capacitor/push-notifications` or Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM).

